identified","verificationNotes":["The supplied name exactly matches the normalized official Steam name for the supplied App ID."],"research":{"steam":{"status":"success","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T09:59:46.514Z","error":null}},"steamMetadata":{"appId":"1218210","links":{"store":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1218210/","officialWebsite":"https://www.coromon.com/","support":"https://www.coromon.com/"},"storageRequirements":{"kind":"required_free_space","windows":{"minimum":{"value":2,"unit":"GB","display":"2 GB","approximateBytes":2000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 2 GB"},"recommended":{"value":2,"unit":"GB","display":"2 GB","approximateBytes":2000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 2 GB"}},"macos":{"minimum":{"value":2,"unit":"GB","display":"2 GB","approximateBytes":2000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 2 GB"},"recommended":{"value":2,"unit":"GB","display":"2 GB","approximateBytes":2000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 2 GB"}},"linux":{"minimum":null,"recommended":null},"note":"Steam publishes required free space, not the exact installed or download size."},"controllerSupport":{"level":"partial","xboxCompatible":null,"xboxEvidence":null,"note":"Generic Steam controller support does not prove Xbox controller compatibility."},"playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":true,"coop":false,"onlineCoop":false,"localCoop":false,"lanCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"pvp":true,"maximumPlayers":null,"maximumPlayersNote":"The public Steam app-details response does not provide a reliable exact player limit.","evidence":["Single-player","Multi-player","PvP","Online PvP"]},"genres":["Adventure","Indie","RPG","Strategy"],"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":49,"description":"PvP"},{"id":36,"description":"Online PvP"},{"id":27,"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":29,"description":"Steam Trading Cards"},{"id":18,"description":"Partial Controller Support"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}]}},"content":{"status":"success","steamAppId":"1218210","steamName":"Coromon","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1218210/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T07:53:00.339417+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"Embark on a complete 30+ hour monster-taming RPG adventure, now remastered for PC! Catch and train more than 120 Coromon, explore six diverse biomes, and master strategic turn-based battles as you unravel a mystery that could change Velua forever.","detailedDescription":"More than ten years of development have shaped Coromon into a complete 30+ hour monster-taming RPG. Catch and train more than 120 Coromon, master strategic battles, and explore a handcrafted world packed with memorable places and details to discover.\n\nCoromon Remastered optimizes the entire journey for PC, with a presentation designed for larger screens. Clearer menus and battle details make everything easier to understand at a glance, while mouse-hover information and quick battle actions make every interaction faster and more natural.\n\nSIX BIOMES, COUNTLESS SECRETS.\n\nYour first day as a Battle Researcher for Lux Solis should've been straightforward, receive your first Coromon and begin investigating Velua’s six Titans. But when outsiders wielding an element unknown to science attack a  laboratory, your assignment becomes something far more dangerous.\n\nTravel through six distinct biomes, each with its own challenges and mysteries. Begin among the fields around Hayville, then journey to a thunderous city, through a haunted swamp, into a guarded desert palace, beneath a volcano, and across frozen mountains toward ancient ruins.\n\nBetween your main objectives, meet the people who call Velua home, help solve their problems, and leave the path for side quests, secrets, and minigames. Upgrade your Gauntlet to open blocked routes and reveal hidden items, then take to the water as even more of the world opens around you.\n\nWHAT DOES IT TAKE TO WIN A COROMON BATTLE?\n\nMore than raw power! Build your Squad around Skills, Traits, and held items. Then adapt to entry hazards, weather, and status effects to outsmart any opponent you meet, whether it's a wild Coromon, rival Battle Researchers, or a mighty Titan.\n\n• \nMaster a stamina-based battle system where every Skill costs energy. Spend too much and your Coromon will need to rest, giving its opponent an opening.\n\n• \nHunt for rare Potent and Perfect Coromon. Their distinctive colors make them stand out, and they can earn additional bonus stat points which you can distribute yourself.\n\n• \nEvolve a Coromon for higher base stats, or keep it unevolved and enhance its Trait with additional or stronger effects.\n\nUNRAVEL A MYSTERY BEYOND SCIENCE\n\nAs you track down each Titan, the scope of your mission grows. Every region brings a new crisis, an unexpected discovery, and another clue to the outsiders’ plans. Cross paths with new allies, survive dangerous expeditions, and venture into places no Battle Researcher was ever meant to reach.\n\nAs the pieces connect, you uncover a power capable of changing Velua’s natural order. And by the end of your journey, only one question matters: who, or what, is really in control?\n\nYOUR JOURNEY, YOUR RULES\n\nCoromon lets you shape the adventure around the way you want to play.\n\n• \nLooking for a relaxed playthrough? Make shops and recovery more forgiving, or reduce the pressure of battle and focus on exploring Velua, building your squad and following the story.\n\n• \nLooking for higher stakes? Combine built-in Randomizer settings with configurable difficulty rules to change encounters, trainers, Skills, Traits, items, evolutions and even the order of the Titans.\n\n• \nCreate the Battle Researcher you want to be with a wide selection of outfits, hairstyles, facial hair, headgear and colors.\n\n• \nGive your Coromon new looks with unlockable Skins earned through collecting, battles, side quests, minigames and other gameplay challenges.\n\nTHE FINAL TITAN ISN’T THE END\n\nContinue beyond the story in the endless Battle Dome, where Coromon Rush, Trainer Rush and Titan Rush challenge you to see how far your squad can go. Test your strategies against other players in ranked, casual or custom 3v3 and 6v6 battles.\n\nA WORD FROM THE DEVELOPERS\n\nWe’re an independent studio that started with a big dream: to create the ultimate retro monster-taming adventure we always wanted to play, with the care and quality-of-life features we value in modern games.\n\nWe believe in handcrafted worlds, memorable places and thoughtful details. That philosophy shaped Coromon, brought Coromon Remastered to life, and continues to guide us as we build Coromon: Rogue Planet. We’re incredibly proud of how far that original dream has taken us, and grateful to everyone joining us on the journey.","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1218210/6005d622740cc34589b36ab64eb2850c406b5432/header.jpg?t=1789461207"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1218210/4fdb1c5d600763b0f088d1aa8bfacb694cfccfee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1789461207"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1218210/cc71607f945ff06c8b15af4555c92c6e884402f2/ss_cc71607f945ff06c8b15af4555c92c6e884402f2.600x338.jpg?t=1789461207","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1218210/cc71607f945ff06c8b15af4555c92c6e884402f2/ss_cc71607f945ff06c8b15af4555c92c6e884402f2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789461207"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1218210/f1b479f6ee1331406aeb74acc01d649b7996ff6d/ss_f1b479f6ee1331406aeb74acc01d